    metal_gpu_only_cpu_mirror_composite_labelled_device_readback_2026-11-26, 0, "In gpu_only mode MetalBackend draw_rect_blend / gradient / radial fills (backend_metal.spl ~2280-2325) download the framebuffer into the CPU mirror, rasterize there, and re-upload via _commit_gpu_only_cpu_composite, then set gpu_frame_complete=true; read_pixels_with_source then labels the frame ReadbackSource.DeviceReadback. A CPU-composited frame is reported as device evidence."

